Z||000003||theogre||01-08-2001||12:00 AM||||For a single wire, if you are installing the old wire,,, tie a long string to the latch end of the 86 harness before you pull it out. use the string to help pull the 85 latch wire back in.<P>mark the latch before you take it off. then you can get it back in the same place easy.||||reg||1
